# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RAEngine - repository ignore rules
#
# Tracked: include/ src/ samples/ tests/ Shaders/ Projects/ vendor/ docs/
# scripts/ assets/, plus RAEngine.sln, RAEngine.vcxproj(.filters), RAEngine.rc
# and the CMake files. Everything a build, an IDE, or a test run produces stays
# local.
#
# Note: *.obj is intentionally NOT ignored globally because Wavefront OBJ meshes
# under Projects/*/Content/Meshes/ are source content. Compiler object files
# only appear inside the ignored build directories.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Build output
/build/
/build-*/
/out/
/install/
/install-*/
/.vs/
x64/
*.res
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate

# Compiled binaries and linker intermediates
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.map

# IDE / editor state
.idea/
*.sln.iml
*.user
*.suo
*.vcxproj.user
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
imgui.ini

# Test / validation output
/screenshots/
/artifacts/
Testing/

# Operating system junk
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Temporary files
*.tmp